 Set up the Cloudflare tunnel                                                                                     5 / 7
 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

   Tunnel name  › bonsai
     The tunnel from: cloudflared tunnel create <name>. Bonsai points it at the receiver (127.0.0.1:7002); ingress
     rules in your own cloudflared config take precedence.

 › Public URL   › http://hooks.example.com
     The hostname routed to the tunnel: cloudflared tunnel route dns <name> <hostname>.

  ✗ Public URL must be an https:// address with no path, for example https://hooks.example.com.




























